  "sourceReviewAdjudication": [
    "The test callback receives only the transport current sector, range-checked against the mounted nine-sector fixture before flush; the fixture is exactly nine sectors and the contract writes sector zero, so the reported overflow cannot occur.",
    "The setter checks a null pointer before dereferencing it and returns WZ_RESULT_INVALID_ARGUMENT; the caller has validated the slot and mounted its image.",
    "The separate EF and F7 read branches preserve port-specific behavior; repeated conditions are a stylistic suggestion with no correctness defect.",
    "Deserialization rejects every length except the fixed WZ_STATE_MACHINE_LENGTH before reading extension fields, so the added byte is inside the fixed extension capacity for all eight drives."
  ]
